"\s[10]\f[TS]\m[pm-00ff00]A section with a\m[]\f[]\s[0]" "\s[10]\f[TS]\m[pm-00ff00]rather long title\m[]\f[]\s[0]" "\s[10]\f[TS]\m[pm-00ff00]that wraps\m[]\f[]\s[0]"  at (0.738, -0.337)
box wid 1.302 ht 0.927 rad 0.043 at (2.083, -0.55) shaded "pm-dcb9ff" outlined "pm-dcb9ff" thickness 0.625
"\s[10]\f[TS]\m[pm-ffffff]B\m[]\f[]\s[0]"  at (2.083, -0.17)
